@startuml
title UC01 - Diagrama de Sequência
actor "Utilizador" as U
participant "CreateAccountActivity" as UI
participant "GymApiService\n(Retrofit)" as API
database "RestDB" as BD

U -> UI : Clica em "Registar"
UI -> UI : Valida campos vazios
UI -> API : criarUtilizador(novoUtilizador)
API -> BD : POST /users
BD --> API : 201 Created (JSON)
API --> UI : onResponse()
UI --> U : Mostra Toast "Sucesso" e executa finish()
@enduml